{"title": "Armour of Landfall", "pageid": 9476, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall", "categories": ["Light Armour", "Very rare items", "Druid set", "Self-Heal set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png/300px-Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/03/Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Landfall image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png/300px-Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Armour_of_Landfall_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Armour of Landfall</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Light_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">light armour</a> which improves the spellcasting ability of its wearer and grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. The wearer also heals while standing in vines and can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/25px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/38px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/50px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Plant Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/25px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\">Plant Growth</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Smelling of long-abandoned gardens grown wild with thorny roses, moss and hibiscus, this armour was worn by a powerful druid who spent so long from people that she forgot to miss them.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 13\">13</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" title=\"Light Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Armour\">Light Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" title=\"Light Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Armour\">Light Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 4.5 kg (9 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 4.5 kg (9 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-